# Disabled for the move to server rendering (ADR-001).
#
# With output: 'server', `npm run build` no longer produces HTML pages: dist/client holds
# only assets and dist/server holds the server code. The CDK stack uploads all of ../dist
# and deletes anything in the bucket that isn't in the upload, so running this would wipe
# the live static site and make the server code publicly downloadable. Until the static
# site has a build of its own, it stays live, frozen at its last static deploy.
#
# Running `cdk deploy` by hand from AWS-cdk/ would do the same damage.

